.vscode/**
.gitignore
# **`node_modules/` is NOT ignored**, and that is deliberate: `vscode-languageclient`
# is a *runtime* dependency, so a `.vsix` built without it fails to activate with
# "Cannot find module 'vscode-languageclient/node'". `vsce` prunes
# devDependencies on its own, so only the client and its transitive deps ship.
# If the extension ever gains a bundler (esbuild/webpack), this line comes back
# and `main` points at the bundle instead.
out/**/*.map
out/*.test.js
src/**
tsconfig.json
**/*.ts
*.vsix
